1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,240
How do you install the same system on a laptop and in a bank?

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:09,120
The cook uses one recipe in every kitchen; only where the ingredients come from changes.

3
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:13,296
The install is the same on a laptop, a test server and production.

4
00:00:13,346 --> 00:00:17,352
Only the values differ, written down once for each environment.

5
00:00:17,402 --> 00:00:21,456
The card zone goes first, and ecom waits for its certificate.

6
00:00:21,506 --> 00:00:26,040
A preflight checks the machine first, and says exactly what to fix.

7
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:30,312
Then Vault is set up, and every service's settings are written from it.

8
00:00:30,362 --> 00:00:35,232
The services start in order, and the install ends with a health check of both products.

9
00:00:35,282 --> 00:00:39,072
A later change is just a new value, applied the same way.

10
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:42,144
Next: how a release is numbered and shipped.
